rooms_desc ({"This is a quite room in the house of NargThe walls are painted a soft white, andOak hard wood floors fill the room.The furnishings are made of fine Cherry and Walnutwith plush velore coverings.A large Cobelstone fireplace lines one wall,with a soft orange flame warming the room.","This is Nargs Dojang were he come to practice Hap Ki Doa Korean martial art. The floor is well padded, and a Korean Flag hangs on one wall, The east wall isdecorated with Narg's belts, and weapons.","This is a dimly lit bedroom.  There is a Queen size four poster waterbedon the south wall. A Dresser sets left of the door with candles burning bbrightly. next to the bed is a night stand with a crystal oil lamp burning.On th east wall is a stone fire place with a small roaring fire in it.you can hear the fire crack and pop and a smell of jasmine wafts through theair.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
